<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 10.42PCT FROM 10.40PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FIRMS TO 10.42PCT FROM 10.40PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month firmed to 10.42 percent from 10.40</p>
<p>percent and the bid rate (Athibid) rose to 9.94 percent from</p>
<p>9.92 percent.</p>
